{"step_index":3260,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-19T05:39:53Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-19T12:39:53+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-19T12:39:53+07:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-19T12:39:53+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-19T12:39:53+07:00\nShowing lines 1-50 of 25553\n1: ======================================================================\n2: ### “SUCH A SPLENDID TALE AND SUCH A FANTISTORICAL! I READ MY EYES OUT.”—ANNE MCCAFFREY - “MARTIN MAKES A TRIUMPHANT RETURN TO HIGH FANTASY.… [HIS] TROPHY CASE IS ALREADY STUFFED WITH MAJOR PRIZES, INCLUDING HUGOS, NEBULAS, LOCUS AWARDS AND A BRAM STOKER. HE’S PROBABLY GOING TO HAVE TO ADD ANOTHER SHELF, AT LEAST.” —PUBLISHERS WEEKLY (STARRED REVIEW)\n3: ======================================================================\n4: \n5: A Game of Thrones\n6: \n7: Anne McCaffrey: \"Ceritanya gokil abis, bener-bener fantasi sejarah yang epic parah! Gue baca sampai mata gue mau copot saking nagihnya.\"\n8: \n9: Publishers Weekly: \"George R. R. Martin balik lagi ke genre high fantasy (subgenre fantasi berlatar dunia fiksi total dengan sihir dan konflik kolosal) dengan gaya luar biasa sakti. Lemari pialanya udah penuh sesak sama penghargaan bergengsi kelas kakap macam Hugo, Nebula, Locus, sampai Bram Stoker. Kayaknya dia minimal kudu nambah satu rak lemari baru lagi saking banyaknya piala.\"\n10: \n11: Marion Zimmer Bradley: \"Bisa jadi ini buku fantasi epik paling yahud yang pernah ada.\"\n12: \n13: The Denver Post: \"Karya fantasi paling guncang dekade ini... bikin nagih parah dan nggak bisa berhenti dibaca.\"\n14: \n15: Raymond E. Feist: \"George R. R. Martin emang salah satu penulis fiksi ilmiah terbaik yang kita punya, dan buku ini jelas salah satu karya terbaiknya dia seumur-umur.\"\n16: \n17: Chicago Sun-Times: \"Kita kayak diundang ke pesta perjamuan raksasa yang super megah. George R. R. Martin ngebuka dunia yang bener-bener hidup, romantis tapi tetep realistis dan kejam tanpa ampun. Kalau dua buku kelanjutannya sekeren jilid yang ini, petualangan ini beneran bakal jadi santapan pesta yang luar biasa nikmat.\"\n18: \n19: Science Fiction Chronicle: \"Peristiwa penerbitan buku fantasi paling gede dan paling pecah sepanjang tahun 1996.\"\n20: \n21: \n22: \n23: ======================================================================\n24: ### By George R. R. Martin - A SONG OF ICE AND FIREBook One: A Game of ThronesBook Two: A Clash of KingsBook Three: A Storm of SwordsBook Four: A Feast for CrowsBook Five: A Dance with Dragons\n25: ======================================================================\n26: \n27: A Game of Thrones (Perebutan Takhta Berdarah)\n28: \n29: Karya: George R. R. Martin\n30: \n31: SERIAL A SONG OF ICE AND FIRE:\n32: Buku Satu: A Game of Thrones\n33: Buku Dua: A Clash of Kings\n34: Buku Tiga: A Storm of Swords\n35: Buku Empat: A Feast for Crows\n36: Buku Lima: A Dance with Dragons\n37: \n38: NOVEL LAINNYA:\n39: Dying of the Light\n40: Windhaven (bareng Lisa Tuttle)\n41: Fevre Dream\n42: The Armageddon Rag\n43: Dead Man’s Hand (bareng John J. Miller)\n44: \n45: KUMPULAN CERITA PENDEK:\n46: Dreamsongs, Volume I\n47: Dreamsongs, Volume II\n48: A Song of Lya and Other Stories\n49: Songs of Stars and Shadows\n50: Sandkings"}
